# Oukitel K9 Ubuntu Touch Kernel

Linux 4.9.117 kernel source for the Oukitel K9, adapted for Ubuntu Touch and Halium.

## Device

- Device: Oukitel K9
- Architecture: ARM64
- Platform: MediaTek MT6765/MT6761 family
- Kernel: Linux 4.9.117
- Target configuration: `k65v1_64_bsp_defconfig`

## Included fixes

- Ubuntu Touch and Halium kernel configuration
- Display and touchscreen compatibility
- Camera sensor support
- Display panel support
- Sensor and screen-rotation fixes
- Bluetooth compatibility module
- GPS compatibility
- External loudspeaker amplifier GPIO support

## Toolchain

The kernel was built using the Android GCC 4.9 ARM64 toolchain:

```text
aarch64-linux-android-4.9
